 ## Context-bounded territories and shared outcomes
 
-Treat reviewability and recipient context fit as planning constraints, not only implementation concerns. Bound what each author or reviewer must consider together without reducing design completeness. A complete package may span linked files and bounded sessions. Preserve necessary detail, useful rationale, exact prior artifacts, and evidence; do not replace them with a shorter summary that loses obligations.
